<title>UK: Chile buys two cargoes white sugar - traders.</title>
<headline>Chile buys two cargoes white sugar - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile recently bought two cargoes of white sugar for arrival in October and November, European trade sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The price paid was in the region of $26 above London's nearby October futures contract on a C&amp;FFO freight basis, they said.</p>
<p>Arrival dates for the cargoes were October 15 and November 15. The seller and origin of the sugar were not yet known.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
